Package: popart
Type: Package
Title: Population-Augmented Analysis of Randomized Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Zhitan",
    family = "He",
    email = "zhitanhe21@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Fits augmented inverse probability weighting estimators to a
    randomized-trial sample and an auxiliary target-population sample. Highly
    adaptive lasso nuisance regressions are used to estimate trial selection,
    outcome, and censoring mechanisms. The main interface accepts user-supplied
    data frames and returns arm means, treatment contrasts, covariance
    estimates, Wald confidence intervals, and fit diagnostics.
